ーンの描写をお願いいたします\nA: レイプ前(睨んだ後見せ槍に動揺）と処女喪失の瞬間(痛みに目を見開き涙が出てくる)\nB: ピストン最中（目を痛みに細めている表情と、恐怖顔のような口と目を見開いて中出ししないよう懇願する表情）\nC: 膣内射精 (精液を注ぎ込まれているとき目を閉じて口を大きく悲鳴を上げている）\nD: 事後　心が折れて死んだ目で子供の用に泣きじゃくっている\n\n挿入後以降のシーンでは破瓜の血と股間に透過断面図表現が欲しいです\n\n参考資料\n(1) シチュエーションのおおまかな構図\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/90645969　これの1枚目\n(2) モデルとなるキャラクターの画像：\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FWq9gWgagAEAPkQ?format=jpg&name=large\n(3) 破瓜血を含んだペニス\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/26580578\nご検討のほど、お願い申し上げます", "nc": 185, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "video", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 11069, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "ワイト", "screen_name": "seihekiog", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1726812286755749888/PAQZPjRr.png", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 32}, {"id": 16597, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "朧雲たかみつ🐄🔞🥛Skeb募集中", "screen_name": "oborotaka", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1899903136162361344/X2vRf_aA.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/512756722/1649551307/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 49}, {"id": 63080, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "ワルノリ", "screen_name": "agseaneins", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1858397224407044096/3tvSU9A7.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/211384635/1473679